(text "XIAO USB-C is the only power input. All module VCC pins receive 3.3 V." (at 35.56 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "56b8a259-a3ff-5992-8e2f-72d0ab268279"))
(text "J1: wire to OLED labels GND / VCC / SCL / SDA. J2: wire to IMU labels VCC / GND / SCL / SDA." (at 35.56 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b0865ecf-c535-58ef-814c-a09be43cf59d"))
(text "GY-521 AD0 must be low for 0x68. Keep the IMU horizontal, rigidly mounted, and align axes." (at 35.56 171.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "77f75c9f-80f0-508b-9a7b-a146ff39337c"))
(text "R1/R2 are optional pull-up footprints: DO NOT POPULATE until the breakout pull-ups are checked." (at 35.56 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "db473f74-af2c-56bb-b92b-0934925f9009"))
(text "D3 button uses firmware INPUT_PULLUP. No battery, car wiring, or radio functionality is used." (at 35.56 184.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5e66b07f-5938-5a47-a77b-d9c338a9e5c1"))
)
